  "style": "chibi cube pet, deliberately blocky (Kenney Cube Pets): the pack's giraffe is a neckless head-body cube with ossicones, so its size is the cube's; stylized size: 2.4 m to the ossicone tips (a real giraffe is ~5 m tall), so it is the tallest animal in the library like the real one, standing just above the cube-pet elephant (2.0 m) and well above the horse (1.7 m) and lion (1.3 m); scaling it to its real height would make a 4.5 m-wide cube that dwarfs the elephant, and the cube itself (2.0 m to the crown) matches the elephant's; rigid parts moved by node tracks, no skin; colour map flattened to flat colours (maxColors 32 keeps the spots, eyes and nose apart; at 16 the eye whites and pupils merged into the coat)",
