    "note": "The plan's own source (wave-1 row 22). Same zip, pin and route as the elephant and lion: ingested through Blender with Textures/colormap.png as an extra member. The colour map flattens to 32 colours: the yellow-to-orange gradient -> coat, the browns (two side spots, ossicone knobs, snout, hooves) -> spots, inner ears and ossicone stems -> muzzle."
